<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 3: Intrusion Symptoms (DSM-5 Cluster B)</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">
        In the past month, how much were you bothered by&hellip;
        (0 Not at all &middot; 1 A little bit &middot; 2 Moderately &middot; 3 Quite a bit &middot; 4 Extremely)
    </p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="item1">1. Repeated, disturbing, and unwanted memories of the stressful experience?</label>
        <select id="item1" name="cluster_b.item1_repeated_disturbing_memories">
            <option value="" {% if cluster_b.item1RepeatedDisturbingMemories == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="0" {% if cluster_b.item1RepeatedDisturbingMemories == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 - Not at all</option>
            <option value="1" {% if cluster_b.item1RepeatedDisturbingMemories == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 - A little bit</option>
            <option value="2" {% if cluster_b.item1RepeatedDisturbingMemories == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 - Moderately</option>
            <option value="3" {% if cluster_b.item1RepeatedDisturbingMemories == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 - Quite a bit</option>
            <option value="4" {% if cluster_b.item1RepeatedDisturbingMemories == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 - Extremely</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="item2">2. Repeated, disturbing dreams of the stressful experience?</label>
        <select id="item2" name="cluster_b.item2_repeated_disturbing_dreams">
            <option value="" {% if cluster_b.item2RepeatedDisturbingDreams == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="0" {% if cluster_b.item2RepeatedDisturbingDreams == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 - Not at all</option>
            <option value="1" {% if cluster_b.item2RepeatedDisturbingDreams == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 - A little bit</option>
            <option value="2" {% if cluster_b.item2RepeatedDisturbingDreams == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 - Moderately</option>
            <option value="3" {% if cluster_b.item2RepeatedDisturbingDreams == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 - Quite a bit</option>
            <option value="4" {% if cluster_b.item2RepeatedDisturbingDreams == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 - Extremely</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="item3">3. Suddenly feeling or acting as if the stressful experience were actually happening again (reliving)?</label>
        <select id="item3" name="cluster_b.item3_feeling_reliving">
            <option value="" {% if cluster_b.item3FeelingReliving == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="0" {% if cluster_b.item3FeelingReliving == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 - Not at all</option>
            <option value="1" {% if cluster_b.item3FeelingReliving == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 - A little bit</option>
            <option value="2" {% if cluster_b.item3FeelingReliving == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 - Moderately</option>
            <option value="3" {% if cluster_b.item3FeelingReliving == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 - Quite a bit</option>
            <option value="4" {% if cluster_b.item3FeelingReliving == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 - Extremely</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="item4">4. Feeling very upset when something reminded you of the stressful experience?</label>
        <select id="item4" name="cluster_b.item4_feeling_upset_by_reminders">
            <option value="" {% if cluster_b.item4FeelingUpsetByReminders == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="0" {% if cluster_b.item4FeelingUpsetByReminders == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 - Not at all</option>
            <option value="1" {% if cluster_b.item4FeelingUpsetByReminders == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 - A little bit</option>
            <option value="2" {% if cluster_b.item4FeelingUpsetByReminders == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 - Moderately</option>
            <option value="3" {% if cluster_b.item4FeelingUpsetByReminders == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 - Quite a bit</option>
            <option value="4" {% if cluster_b.item4FeelingUpsetByReminders == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 - Extremely</option>
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="item5">5. Having strong physical reactions when something reminded you of the stressful experience?</label>
        <select id="item5" name="cluster_b.item5_strong_physical_reactions">
            <option value="" {% if cluster_b.item5StrongPhysicalReactions == null %}selected{% endif %}>&mdash;</option>
            <option value="0" {% if cluster_b.item5StrongPhysicalReactions == 0 %}selected{% endif %}>0 - Not at all</option>
            <option value="1" {% if cluster_b.item5StrongPhysicalReactions == 1 %}selected{% endif %}>1 - A little bit</option>
            <option value="2" {% if cluster_b.item5StrongPhysicalReactions == 2 %}selected{% endif %}>2 - Moderately</option>
            <option value="3" {% if cluster_b.item5StrongPhysicalReactions == 3 %}selected{% endif %}>3 - Quite a bit</option>
            <option value="4" {% if cluster_b.item5StrongPhysicalReactions == 4 %}selected{% endif %}>4 - Extremely</option>
        </select>
    </div>
</div>
